{"id":"n72049-1-7","stage":4,"title":"이름나다 · 闻名","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72049-1-7-1","ko":"어디에 여행을 가면 좋을까요?","zh":"去哪儿旅行比较好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행을","audio":"/audio/8e4d1a5a7460b5dcfa6a.mp3"}},{"text":"가면","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가면","audio":"/audio/3f7693768451c0cae806.mp3"}},{"text":"좋을까요?","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋을까요","audio":"/audio/4799ead06e7db95648e5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/48e9d74776efa042e20b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72049-1-7-2","ko":"제주도에 가 보세요. 제주도는 전 세계에서 아름답기로 이름난 곳이에요.","zh":"可以去济州岛看看。济州岛可是以美丽著称、享誉全球的地方哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제주도에","meaning":"济州岛","explanation":"제주도：济州岛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"제주도에","audio":"/audio/a56332c57b721e11f8a6.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제주도에","audio":"/audio/a56332c57b721e11f8a6.mp3"}},{"text":"가","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가","audio":"/audio/64ee5293d31bc58b72d7.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}},{"text":"제주도는","meaning":"济州岛","explanation":"제주도：济州岛；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"제주도는","audio":"/audio/827da8b3eb4ff81981ca.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제주도는","audio":"/audio/827da8b3eb4ff81981ca.mp3"}},{"text":"전","meaning":"前","explanation":"전：前。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17306","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}},{"text":"세계에서","meaning":"世界","explanation":"세계：世界；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62444","senseId":"1","lemma":"세계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세계에서","audio":"/audio/7ffe5d5102db2e191bed.mp3"}},{"text":"아름답기로","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름답기로","audio":"/audio/da5bda8c648c6e42ca5e.mp3"}},{"text":"이름난","meaning":"闻名，扬名","explanation":"이름나다：闻名，扬名；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"이름나다","audio":"/audio/0a27ac59d0f6cd11c984.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72049","senseId":"1","lemma":"이름나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이름난","audio":"/audio/8b9ae501d8da44ef0765.mp3"}},{"text":"곳이에요.","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳이에요","audio":"/audio/890f51d2dd2ea39c9f55.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17306","definition":"以前的。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"28403a52feffec21","term":"세계","zh":"世界","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3","entryId":"62444","definition":"地球上的所有国家。","pronunciation":["세ː계","세ː게"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":[